{"type":"message","id":"02103aaa","parentId":"29d8c480","timestamp":"2026-02-02T16:50:56.355Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:58","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"EQUIPMENT SYMBOL LEGEND\nEQUIPMENT GENERAL NOTES\n2.B\n5.B\n1.B\nC.B\nE.B\nI.B\nG.B\n6.B\n2.B1\nDECONTAMINATION\nDECONTAMINATION\nEXISTING \nRECREATION DECK \nABOVE\nDN\nAMBULANCE COURT\nEXISTING EMERGENCY\nCANOPY ABOVE\nBIKE \nRACK\nNEW RAMP WITH ASPHALT\nBACK BOARD \nWEAPON DETECTION\nBACK BOARD \nAUTO OPERATOR \nDROMA ED 250\nHAND-WAVE \nPLATE\nHC PLATE ON \nPEDESTAL\n360\n360 CAMERA\n30\"x48\" Clearance \nfor Wheelchair\nFAS\nFAS\nFAS\nFAS\nFAS\nSURFACE MOUNTED \nELECTRIC PANEL, SEE \nMEP DWGS FOR \nADDITIONAL INFO\nHC PLATE ON \nPEDESTAL\nSPRINKLER CONTROL \nCABINET, SEE MEP DRAWINGS \nFOR ADDITIONAL INFO\nCART WASH\n1\nSECURITY\n2\nENTRANCE\nVESTIBULE\n4\nNYPD\nSECURITY\nPICKUP\n3\nCART\nALCOVE\n5\n001\nEQUIPMENT TAG\nDOOR HARDWARE\nCR    \nCARD READER\nFIRE ALARM\nS\n    STROBE\n                    360 CAMERA\n                    FIRE ALARM SYSTEM\nNURSE CALL\nNC    \nNURSE CALL\nTELEPHONE/DATA\nD\n   \nDATA\n       T            TELEPHONE\nELECTRICAL\nN\n   DUPLEX NORMAL POWER\nN\n   QUAD NORMAL POWER\nN\n  FLOOR QUAD POWER\nLS\n   LIGHT SWITCH\n1. \nCONTRACTOR SHALL REVIEW AND COORDINATE WITH THE EQUIPMENT \nMANUAL AND / OR EQUIPMENT SCHEDULE FOR SCOPE OF WORK AND \nRESPONSIBILITY IN THE PURCHASING, PLACEMENT AND INSTALLATION OF \nEQUIPMENT.\n2. \nCONTRACTOR SHALL PROVIDE ALL MPE ROUGH-INS FOR ALL EQUIPMENT \nAS INDICATED ON THE DRAWINGS AND / OR EQUIPMENT MANUAL , \nWHETHER PROVIDED BY OWNER, OWNER VENDOR, OR GC / CM.\n3. \nCONTRACTOR SHALL PROVIDE IN-WALL BLOCKING FOR ALL WALL \nMOUNTED EQUIPMENT, WHETHER PROVIDED BY OWNER, OWNER \nVENDOR, OR GC / CM.\n4. \nCONTRACTOR SHALL REVIEW AND COORDINATE WITH THE VENDOR \nEQUIPMENT DRAWINGS FOR RESPONSIBILITY AND SCOPE OF WORK IN \nTHE INSTALLATION OF VENDOR EQUIPMENT. ALL WORK REFERRED TO IN \nTHE VENDOR EQUIPMENT DRAWINGS AS BY OWNER / CUSTOMER, \nCONTRACTOR OR BY OTHERS IS IN THE SCOPE OF WORK OF THE GC / CM.\n5. \nTHE CONTRACTOR SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR COORDINATING WITH \nTHE OWNER’S EQUIPMENT VENDORS TO INSURE THE PROPER \nINSTALLATION OF ALL  OWNER-FURNISHED ITEMS.\n360\nFAS\n200 MADISON AVENUE, 14TH FLOOR\nNEW YORK, NY 10016\n212-689-3110\nARRAY-ARCHITECTS.COM\nPROJECT NO.\nDATE\nCONTRACT NO.\nCON/REF NO.\nF\nE\nD\nC\nB\nA\n8\n7\n6\n5\n4\n3\n2\n1\nC  COPYRIGHT - 2025 ARRAY ARCHITECTS\nIN COLLABORATION WITH:\nDOSHI ENGINEERING PLLC\nMEP ENGINEER\n350 SEVENTH AVENUE, 15th FLOOR,\nNEW YORK, NY 10001\nPHONE: 718 896 9324\nPROJECT:\nISSUES:\nSEAL:\nKEYPLAN:\nYSRAEL A. SEINUK, P.C.\nSTRUCTURAL ENGINEER\n228 EAST 45TH STREET, 2ND FLOOR\nNEW YORK, NY  10017\nPHONE: 212 687 2233\nYU & ASSOCIATES\nGEOTECHNICAL & CIVIL ENGINEER\n611 RIVER DRIVE\nELMWOOD PARK, NY  07407\nPHONE: 201 791 0057\nMG ENGINEERING D.P.C.\nMEDICAL EQ, AV/IT, SECURITY ENGINEER\n116 WEST 32ND STREET\nNEW YORK, NY  10001\nPHONE: 212 643 9055  \nENVIRONMENTAL PLANNING \nMANAGEMENT\nENVIRONMENTAL ENGINEER\n1983 MARCUS AVENUE, SUITE 109\nLAKE SUCCESS, NY  11042\nPHONE: 516 328 1194 \n9/25/2025 10:52:33 AM\nAutodesk Docs://6829 - H+H Bellevue Ambulance Bay Addition/6829-ARCH- ED ADDITION-25.rvt\nISSUED SOLUTION FOR BID\n09/25/25 A-102 .00\nEQUIPMENT PLAN\nED AMBULANCE\nBAY ADDITION\nH+H Bellevue\n6829\n09/25/25\n462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\nISSUED SOLTUION FOR BID 2025\n1/4\" = 1'-0\"\nA8\nEQUIPMENT PLAN\nN\nNO. DESCRIPTION\nDATE\n1\nISSUED SOLUTION FOR BID\n09/25/25\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051056354}}
{"type":"message","id":"4890d6fd","parentId":"02103aaa","timestamp":"2026-02-02T16:51:39.046Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the sheet structure now. The drawing list on page 002 shows:\n\n- G-series (General): T-001, G-001 through G-007\n- A-series (Architectural): A-101 through A-801, AD-101, EN-001 through EN-300\n- E-series (Electrical): E-001 through E-402\n- FA-series (Fire Alarm): FA-001 through FA-102\n- M-series (Mechanical): EN-201 through M-501\n- P-series (Plumbing): P-001 through P-500\n- SP-series (Sprinkler): SP-001 through SP-501\n- S/FO-series (Structural/Foundation): FO-001 through S-201\n- H-series (Hazmat): H-001, H-101\n- C-series (Civil): C-001 through C-501\n\nNow let me create a classification script that will identify each sheet.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I can see the sheet structure. Let me create the classification script:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:59","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nPhase 2: Sheet Classification\nClassify each drawing page by discipline and sheet type\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\n\nPROJECT_ROOT = \"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital\"\nDRAWINGS_DIR = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, \"drawings\")\nTEXT_DIR = os.path.join(DRAWINGS_DIR, \"text\")\n\ndef classify_sheet(text, page_num):\n    \"\"\"Classify a sheet based on its text content\"\"\"\n    lines = text.split('\\n')\n    \n    # Initialize classification\n    classification = {\n        \"page_number\": page_num,\n        \"sheet_number\": None,\n        \"discipline\": None,\n        \"discipline_code\": None,\n        \"sheet_title\": None,\n        \"sheet_type\": None\n    }\n    \n    # Look for sheet number patterns in text\n    # Common patterns: A-101, G-001, E-201, etc.\n    sheet_patterns = [\n        r'(?:(?:^|\\n|\\s)([A-Z]{1,3})[-–]?(\\d{3,4})\\b)',  # A-101, FA-001\n        r'(?:(?:^|\\n|\\s)([A-Z]{1,3})\\.(\\d{3})\\b)',  # A.101\n        r'(?:(?:^|\\n|\\s)([A-Z]{2,3})\\s+(\\d{3})\\b)',  # FA 101\n    ]\n    \n    for line in lines[:30]:  # Check first 30 lines\n        # Look for sheet number patterns\n        for pattern in sheet_patterns:\n            match = re.search(pattern, line)\n            if match:\n                discipline = match.group(1)\n                number = match.group(2)\n                classification[\"sheet_number\"] = f\"{discipline}-{number}\"\n                classification[\"discipline_code\"] = discipline\n                break\n        if classification[\"sheet_number\"]:\n            break\n    \n    # Also look for \"ISSUED\" line which often contains sheet number\n    for line in lines:\n        if \"ISSUED\" in line and re.search(r'[A-Z]{1,3}[-\\.]?\\d{3}', line):\n            match = re.search(r'([A-Z]{1,3})[-\\.]?(\\d{3}(?:\\.\\d{2})?)', line)\n            if match and not classification[\"sheet_number\"]:\n                classification[\"sheet_number\"] = f\"{match.group(1)}-{match.group(2)}\"\n                classification[\"discipline_code\"] = match.group(1)\n            break\n    \n    # Determine discipline from code\n    discipline_map = {\n        \"T\": \"General\",\n        \"G\": \"General\",\n        \"A\": \"Architectural\",\n        \"AD\": \"Architectural - Demolition\",\n        \"E\": \"Electrical\",\n        \"FA\": \"Fire Alarm\",\n        \"M\": \"Mechanical\",\n        \"P\": \"Plumbing\",\n        \"SP\": \"Sprinkler\",\n        \"FO\": \"Structural - Foundation\",\n        \"S\": \"Structural\",\n        \"H\": \"Hazmat\",\n        \"C\": \"Civil\",\n        \"EN\": \"Energy/Environmental\"\n    }\n    \n    if classification[\"discipline_code\"]:\n        code = classification[\"discipline_code\"]\n        classification[\"discipline\"] = discipline_map.get(code, \"Unknown\")\n    \n    # Extract sheet title - look for title block area\n    title_keywords = [\"PLAN\", \"ELEVATION\", \"SECTION\", \"DETAIL\", \"SCHEDULE\", \"NOTES\", \"SUMMARY\", \"LEGEND\"]\n    \n    # Look for sheet title in the last portion of text (title block area)\n    for line in lines[-50:]:\n        line = line.strip()\n        if len(line) > 5 and len(line) < 100:\n            if any(kw in line.upper() for kw in title_keywords):\n                # Clean up title\n                if not any(x in line for x in [\"PROJECT:\", \"DATE:\", \"CONTRACT\", \"COPYRIGHT\"]):\n                    classification[\"sheet_title\"] = line\n                    break\n    \n    # Determine sheet type\n    if classification[\"sheet_title\"]:\n        title = classification[\"sheet_title\"].upper()\n        if \"DEMO\" in title or \"DEMOLITION\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Demolition\"\n        elif \"FLOOR PLAN\" in title or \"CONSTRUCTION PLAN\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Floor Plan\"\n        elif \"EQUIPMENT PLAN\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Equipment Plan\"\n        elif \"REFLECTED CEILING\" in title or \"CEILING PLAN\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Reflected Ceiling Plan\"\n        elif \"ELEVATION\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Elevation\"\n        elif \"SECTION\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Section\"\n        elif \"DETAIL\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Detail\"\n        elif \"SCHEDULE\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Schedule\"\n        elif \"SITE PLAN\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Site Plan\"\n        elif \"NOTES\" in title or \"SUMMARY\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Notes/Summary\"\n        elif \"LEGEND\" in title:\n            classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Legend\"\n    \n    # Also check sheet number for type hints\n    if classification[\"sheet_number\"]:\n        sn = classification[\"sheet_number\"]\n        if \"-10\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Floor Plan\"\n        elif \"-20\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Elevation/Section\"\n        elif \"-30\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Details\"\n        elif \"-40\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Interior Elevations/Details\"\n        elif \"-50\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"RCP/Ceiling\"\n        elif \"-70\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Schedules/Legends\"\n        elif \"-80\" in sn:\n            if classification[\"sheet_type\"] is None:\n                classification[\"sheet_type\"] = \"Finish Plan\"\n    \n    return classification\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(\"PHASE 2: SHEET CLASSIFICATION\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    \n    # Load manifest\n    with open(os.path.join(DRAWINGS_DIR, \"manifest.json\"), \"r\") as f:\n        manifest = json.load(f)\n    \n    classifications = []\n    sheet_index = {}\n    \n    for page_info in manifest[\"pages\"]:\n        page_num = page_info[\"page_number\"]\n        page_str = page_info[\"page_str\"]\n        \n        # Read text file\n        text_path = os.path.join(TEXT_DIR, f\"page_{page_str}.txt\")\n        with open(text_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            text = f.read()\n        \n        # Classify\n        classification = classify_sheet(text, page_num)\n        classification[\"source_pdf\"] = page_info[\"source_pdf\"]\n        classification[\"image_file\"] = page_info[\"image_file\"]\n        classification[\"text_file\"] = page_info[\"text_file\"]\n        \n        classifications.append(classification)\n        \n        # Add to sheet index\n        if classification[\"sheet_number\"]:\n            sheet_index[classification[\"sheet_number\"]] = {\n                \"page_number\": page_num,\n                \"page_str\": page_str,\n                \"discipline\": classification[\"discipline\"],\n                \"sheet_title\": classification[\"sheet_title\"],\n                \"image_file\": page_info[\"image_file\"]\n            }\n        \n        if page_num % 20 == 0 or page_num == manifest[\"total_pages\"]:\n            print(f\"  Classified {page_num}/{manifest['total_pages']} pages...\")\n    \n    # Save classification\n    with open(os.path.join(DRAWINGS_DIR, \"classification.json\"), \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(classifications, f, indent=2)\n    \n    # Save sheet index\n    with open(os.path.join(DRAWINGS_DIR, \"sheet_index.json\"), \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(sheet_index, f, indent=2)\n    \n    # Print summary\n    disciplines = {}\n    sheet_types = {}\n    for c in classifications:\n        d = c.get(\"discipline\") or \"Unknown\"\n        t = c.get(\"sheet_type\") or \"Other\"\n        disciplines[d] = disciplines.get(d, 0) + 1\n        sheet_types[t] = sheet_types.get(t, 0) + 1\n    \n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 70)\n    print(\"CLASSIFICATION COMPLETE\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(f\"\\nBy Discipline:\")\n    for d, count in sorted(disciplines.items()):\n        print(f\"  {d}: {count} sheets\")\n    \n    print(f\"\\nBy Sheet Type:\")\n    for t, count in sorted(sheet_types.items(), key=lambda x: -x[1]):\n        print(f\"  {t}: {count} sheets\")\n    \n    print(f\"\\nSheets indexed: {len(sheet_index)}\")\n    print(f\"  classification.json: {len(classifications)} entries\")\n    print(f\"  sheet_index.json: {len(sheet_index)} entries\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/classify_sheets.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":33558,"output":2590,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36148,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770051056355}}
