{"type":"message","id":"6b3ec14e","parentId":"ac81029c","timestamp":"2026-02-02T16:54:31.215Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:77","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition  \nNew York, New York 10016 \n \n \nLIST OF DRAWING SHEETS \n \n000115 - 4 \n \nC-101.00 \nSITE - PROPOSED IMPROVEMENTS PLAN \nC-102.00 \nSITE - GRADING AND DRAINAGE PLAN \nC-103.00 \nSITE - SOIL EROSION AND SEDIMENT CONTROL PLAN \nC-500.00 \nSITE - CONSTRUCTION DETAILS SHEET 1 \nC-501.00 \nSITE - CONSTRUCTION DETAILS SHEET 2 \n \nEND OF DOCUMENT 000115 \n \n \n\n--- Page 12 ---\nNYC Health + Hospitals \nBellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition  \nNew York, New York 10016 \n \n \nGENERAL REQUIREMENTS \n 010000 - 1 \n \nSECTION 010000 - GENERAL REQUIREMENTS \nPART 1 - GENERAL \n1.1 \nRELATED DOCUMENTS \nA. \nDrawings and general provisions of Contract/s, including General and Supplementary \nConditions governing all Contract/s, Division 1 Specification Sections, Part I: Information for \nBidders and Bid Agreement, apply to this Section. \n1.2 \nSECTION INCLUDES \nA. \nSummary: \n1. \nContract description. \n2. \nWork by Owner. \n3. \nContractor’s use of premises. \n4. \nScheduling. \nB. \nAdministrative Requirements: \n1. \nCoordination. \n2. \nField engineering. \n3. \nNotifications of shutdowns and deliveries. \n4. \nPreconstruction, site mobilization and Pre-installation meetings. \n5. \nProgress meetings. \nC. \nSubmittals: \n1. \nSubmittal procedures. \n2. \nConstruction progress schedules. \n3. \nProposed products list. \n4. \nProduct data. \n5. \nShop drawings. \n6. \nAs-Built drawings \n7. \nSamples. \n8. \nManufacturer’s instructions. \n9. \nManufacturer’s certificates. \nD. \nQuality Requirements: \n1. \nQuality control. \n2. \nTolerances. \n3. \nReferences. \n4. \nLabeling. \n5. \nRegulatory Requirements. \n6. \nTesting and inspection laboratory services. \n7. \nSpecial project procedures \n8. \nManufacturer’s field services and reports. \n9. \nExamination. \n\n--- Page 13 ---\nNYC Health + Hospitals \nBellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition  \nNew York, New York 10016 \n \n \nGENERAL REQUIREMENTS \n 010000 - 2 \n \n10. \nPreparation. \nE. \nTemporary Facilities and Controls: \n1. \nTemporary electricity. \n2. \nTemporary lighting for construction purposes. \n3. \nTemporary heating and cooling. \n4. \nTemporary ventilation. \n5. \nTemporary water service. \n6. \nTemporary sanitary facilities. \n7. \nField offices and sheds. \n8. \nElevators \n9. \nParking. \n10. \nSafety and Safety Signage. \n11. \nProgress cleaning and waste removal. \n12. \nFire prevention facilities. \n13. \nBarriers and fencing. \n14. \nEnclosures. \n15. \nProtection of installed work. \n16. \nSecurity. \n17. \nWater control. \n18. \nPollution and environmental control. \n19. \nRemoval of utilities, facilities, and controls. \nF. \nProduct Requirements: \n1. \nProducts. \n2. \nDelivery, handling, storage, and protection. \n3. \nProduct options. \n4. \nSubstitutions. \nG. \nExecution Requirements: \n1. \nCloseout procedures. \n2. \nFinal cleaning. \n3. \nStarting of systems. \n4. \nDemonstration and instructions. \n5. \nTesting, adjusting and balancing. \n6. \nProtecting installed construction. \n7. \nProject record documents. \n8. \nOperation and maintenance data. \n9. \nSpare parts and maintenance materials. \n10. \nWarranties. \n1.3 \nCONTRACTOR’S USE OF PREMISES \nA. \nLimit use of premises to allow: \n1. \nOwner occupancy. \n2. \nWork by others and work by Owner. \n3. \nWork sequence to allow use of premises. \n\n--- Page 14 ---\n\n[75374 more lines in file. Use offset=1000 to continue]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051271213}}
{"type":"message","id":"b56a77df","parentId":"6b3ec14e","timestamp":"2026-02-02T16:55:04.946Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the specs are formatted with \"SECTION XXXXXX\" headers. Let me rewrite the parser to correctly identify sections using this format.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:78","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nPhase 4b: Specifications Summary - Improved Parser\nParse specs by looking for SECTION headers\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\n\nPROJECT_ROOT = \"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital\"\nSPECS_DIR = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, \"specs\")\n\ndef extract_sections_from_text(text):\n    \"\"\"Extract spec sections using SECTION XXXXXX pattern\"\"\"\n    sections = {}\n    \n    # Pattern for section headers: \"SECTION 01 00 00 - GENERAL REQUIREMENTS\"\n    section_pattern = r'SECTION\\s+(\\d{2}\\s+\\d{2}\\s+\\d{2,4})\\s*[-–]\\s*([^\\n]+)'\n    \n    # Find all section starts\n    matches = list(re.finditer(section_pattern, text))\n    \n    for i, match in enumerate(matches):\n        section_num = match.group(1).strip()\n        section_title = match.group(2).strip()\n        start_pos = match.start()\n        \n        # End position is start of next section or end of text\n        if i + 1 < len(matches):\n            end_pos = matches[i + 1].start()\n        else:\n            end_pos = len(text)\n        \n        section_text = text[start_pos:end_pos]\n        sections[f\"{section_num} - {section_title}\"] = section_text\n    \n    return sections\n\ndef check_icra_content(text):\n    \"\"\"Check for ICRA/hospital-related requirements\"\"\"\n    icra_terms = [\n        \"ICRA\", \"INFECTION CONTROL\", \"INFECTION CONTROL RISK ASSESSMENT\",\n        \"BARRIER\", \"NEGATIVE PRESSURE\", \"ISOLATION\", \"OCCUPIED\",\n        \"PATIENT\", \"HOSPITAL\", \"HEALTHCARE\", \"INTERIM LIFE SAFETY\",\n        \"ILSM\", \"DUST CONTROL\", \"TEMPORARY PARTITION\"\n    ]\n    \n    icra_found = []\n    text_upper = text.upper()\n    \n    for term in icra_terms:\n        if term in text_upper:\n            # Get context\n            idx = text_upper.find(term)\n            start = max(0, idx - 150)\n            end = min(len(text), idx + 300)\n            context = text[start:end].replace('\\n', ' ').strip()\n            if len(context) > 20:\n                icra_found.append(context)\n    \n    return icra_found[:5]  # Limit contexts\n\ndef extract_key_requirements(text):\n    \"\"\"Extract key requirements from section\"\"\"\n    reqs = []\n    \n    # Look for key requirement patterns\n    patterns = [\n        (r'(?:^|\\n)\\s*\\.?\\d+\\.\\d+\\s+([A-Z][^\\n]{20,150})', \"General\"),\n        (r'SUBMITTALS?:\\s*([^\\n]{10,200})', \"Submittal\"),\n        (r'QUALITY\\s+(?:ASSURANCE|CONTROL):\\s*([^\\n]{10,200})', \"QA/QC\"),\n        (r'WARRANT(?:Y|IES):\\s*([^\\n]{10,200})', \"Warranty\"),\n        (r'PROVIDE\\s+([^\\n]{10,200})', \"Provide\"),\n        (r'INSTALL\\s+([^\\n]{10,200})', \"Install\"),\n    ]\n    \n    for pattern, category in patterns:\n        matches = re.findall(pattern, text[:3000], re.IGNORECASE)\n        for match in matches[:3]:\n            match_clean = match.strip()[:200]\n            if len(match_clean) > 15:\n                reqs.append({\n                    \"category\": category,\n                    \"requirement\": match_clean\n                })\n    \n    return reqs[:8]\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(\"PHASE 4b: SPECIFICATIONS SUMMARY (Improved)\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    \n    # Load full text\n    with open(os.path.join(SPECS_DIR, \"spec_full_text.txt\"), \"r\") as f:\n        full_text = f.read()\n    \n    print(f\"\\nExtracting sections from {len(full_text)} characters...\")\n    \n    # Extract sections\n    sections = extract_sections_from_text(full_text)\n    print(f\"Found {len(sections)} sections\")\n    \n    # Process each section\n    sections_data = []\n    divisions = {}\n    icra_sections = []\n    \n    for section_name, text in sections.items():\n        # Parse section number\n        parts = section_name.split(\" - \", 1)\n        if len(parts) == 2:\n            section_num = parts[0].strip()\n            section_title = parts[1].strip()\n        else:\n            section_num = \"00 00 00\"\n            section_title = section_name\n        \n        # Get division\n        div_match = re.match(r'(\\d{2})', section_num)\n        div_num = div_match.group(1) if div_match else \"00\"\n        \n        # Check ICRA\n        icra_context = check_icra_content(text)\n        is_icra = len(icra_context) > 0\n        \n        # Extract requirements\n        reqs = extract_key_requirements(text)\n        \n        section_data = {\n            \"section_number\": section_num,\n            \"title\": section_title,\n            \"division\": div_num,\n            \"text_length\": len(text),\n            \"icra_related\": is_icra,\n            \"icra_context\": icra_context,\n            \"key_requirements\": reqs\n        }\n        \n        sections_data.append(section_data)\n        \n        # Add to division\n        if div_num not in divisions:\n            divisions[div_num] = {\n                \"division_number\": div_num,\n                \"sections\": [],\n                \"icra_related\": False\n            }\n        divisions[div_num][\"sections\"].append(section_data)\n        if is_icra:\n            divisions[div_num][\"icra_related\"] = True\n            icra_sections.append(section_data)\n    \n    # Division names\n    div_names = {\n        \"00\": \"Procurement and Contracting Requirements\",\n        \"01\": \"General Requirements\",\n        \"02\": \"Existing Conditions\",\n        \"03\": \"Concrete\",\n        \"04\": \"Masonry\",\n        \"05\": \"Metals\",\n        \"06\": \"Wood, Plastics, and Composites\",\n        \"07\": \"Thermal and Moisture Protection\",\n        \"08\": \"Openings\",\n        \"09\": \"Finishes\",\n        \"10\": \"Specialties\",\n        \"11\": \"Equipment\",\n        \"12\": \"Furnishings\",\n        \"13\": \"Special Construction\",\n        \"14\": \"Conveying Equipment\",\n        \"21\": \"Fire Suppression\",\n        \"22\": \"Plumbing\",\n        \"23\": \"Heating, Ventilating, and Air Conditioning\",\n        \"25\": \"Integrated Automation\",\n        \"26\": \"Electrical\",\n        \"27\": \"Communications\",\n        \"28\": \"Electronic Safety and Security\",\n        \"31\": \"Earthwork\",\n        \"32\": \"Exterior Improvements\",\n        \"33\": \"Utilities\"\n    }\n    \n    # Build summary\n    summary = {\n        \"project\": \"HHC Bellevue Hospital - Ambulance Drop Off Renovation\",\n        \"total_sections\": len(sections_data),\n        \"total_divisions\": len(divisions),\n        \"icra_section_count\": len(icra_sections),\n        \"divisions\": {},\n        \"sections\": sections_data,\n        \"icra_sections\": icra_sections\n    }\n    \n    for div_num, div_data in sorted(divisions.items()):\n        summary[\"divisions\"][div_num] = {\n            \"name\": div_names.get(div_num, f\"Division {div_num}\"),\n            \"section_count\": len(div_data[\"sections\"]),\n            \"icra_related\": div_data[\"icra_related\"],\n            \"section_numbers\": [s[\"section_number\"] for s in div_data[\"sections\"]]\n        }\n    \n    # Save\n    with open(os.path.join(SPECS_DIR, \"specs_summary.json\"), \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(summary, f, indent=2)\n    \n    # Print summary\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 70)\n    print(\"SPECIFICATIONS SUMMARY\")\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(f\"\\nTotal Sections: {summary['total_sections']}\")\n    print(f\"Divisions: {summary['total_divisions']}\")\n    print(f\"ICRA-Related Sections: {summary['icra_section_count']}\")\n    \n    print(\"\\nBy Division:\")\n    for div_num, div_info in sorted(summary[\"divisions\"].items()):\n        icra = \" ★ ICRA\" if div_info[\"icra_related\"] else \"\"\n        print(f\"  Div {div_num}: {div_info['section_count']:3d} sections - {div_info['name']}{icra}\")\n    \n    if icra_sections:\n        print(\"\\n★ ICRA-Related Sections (Hospital Critical):\")\n        for s in icra_sections[:10]:\n            print(f\"  {s['section_number']}: {s['title']}\")\n        if len(icra_sections) > 10:\n            print(f\"  ... and {len(icra_sections) - 10} more\")\n    \n    print(\"\\n✓ Output saved: specs/specs_summary.json\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/summarize_specs.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":54331,"output":2355,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56686,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770051271215}}
