:   2 sections - Fire Suppression ★ ICRA\n  Div 22:   2 sections - Plumbing ★ ICRA\n  Div 26:  13 sections - Electrical ★ ICRA\n  Div 28:   1 sections - Electronic Safety and Security ★ ICRA\n\n★ ICRA-Related Sections (Hospital Critical):\n  21 00 00: -- Page 358 ---\n  21 05 00: -- Page 384 ---\n  22 00 00: -- Page 480 ---\n  22 05 00: -- Page 498 ---\n  26 05 00: COMMON WORK RESULTS - PART 1 -\n  26 05 01: SUMMARY OF WORK\n  26 05 02: ELECTRICAL ABBREVIATIONS AND DEFINITIONS\n  26 05 03: CODES, FEES\n  26 05 10: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION\n  26 05 15: CEILING, FLOOR AND WALL ELECTRICAL PENETRATION FIRE SEALS\n  ... and 8 more\n\n✓ Output saved: specs/specs_summary.json","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770051308338}}
