{"type":"message","id":"c2a91357","parentId":"5398be01","timestamp":"2026-02-02T16:58:27.817Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pipeline is complete. Let me provide a final summary for the main agent.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ BluePrint Pipeline Complete — HHC Bellevue Hospital\n\n### What Was Accomplished\n\n**All 5 Phases completed successfully:**\n\n| Phase | Output |\n|-------|--------|\n| **Phase 1: PDF Extraction** | 134 drawing pages as PNG + text, 1,136 spec pages, 173 IFB pages |\n| **Phase 2: Sheet Classification** | 134 sheets classified across 14 disciplines (General, Architectural, Structural, MEP, etc.) |\n| **Phase 3: IFB Parsing** | Template IFB identified; 60-line-item bid breakdown template created |\n| **Phase 4: Specifications** | 154 spec sections parsed across 17 CSI divisions; ICRA requirements flagged |\n| **Phase 5: Synthesis** | Project summary, room inventory, scope-by-trade breakdown, flags |\n\n### Key Findings\n\n**Hospital Renovation Critical Items:**\n- **ICRA Required**: Section 015020 mandates infection control barriers, negative pressure, dust control\n- **Asbestos Abatement**: Section 028200/H-series drawings — must complete before construction\n- **ILSM Required**: Section 015010 — interim life safety measures during occupied construction\n\n**Notable Scope:**\n- New ambulance bay canopy (structural steel)\n- Weapon detection/security screening systems\n- Decontamination facilities\n- Flood barriers (removable)\n- Ballistics resistant panels\n- Extensive MEP (46 HVAC sections, 20 electrical sections)\n\n### Files Created\n\n```\ndrawings/\n├── pages/           # 134 PNG images (~270MB)\n├── text/            # 134 text files\n├── manifest.json\n├── classification.json\n├── sheet_index.json\n└── key_sheets.json\n\nspecs/\n├── spec_full_text.txt\n├── specs_raw_text.json\n└── specs_summary.json  # 154 sections\n\nsynthesis/\n├── project_summary.md      # Full project overview\n├── rooms.json              # Functional areas\n├── scope_by_trade.json     # 16 trade categories\n└── flags.json              # Critical issues & warnings\n\nbid_breakdown.json      # 60 CSI line items\ntakeoff_checklist.md    # Takeoff requirements\nSTATUS.md               # Complete status report\n```\n\n### Next Steps (Pending)\n1. Detailed quantity takeoff from A-101, A-801\n2. Door schedule extraction from A-701\n3. Finish schedule extraction from A-801\n4. MEP coordination review from A-501 RCP\n5. ICRA plan development with hospital\n\n**Project Location:** `/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"moonshot","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":72845,"output":564,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73409,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770051498460}}
